This license covers the code in this repository and the text it generates.

Bibliographic metadata stored under `runs/` and `yearly/runs/` was retrieved
from OpenAlex (CC0 1.0), Crossref, arXiv, and Semantic Scholar, and remains
subject to each source's own terms.

Publisher abstract text is NOT redistributed in this repository. Where an
abstract was used as an extraction source, only a sha256 digest per work is
shipped, in `runs/*/private/ABSTRACTS_DIGEST_*.json`. Use
`tools/rehydrate_abstracts.py` to re-fetch abstracts under your own API terms.
